    @player &#FFF59D&lH&#FFF176&lo&#FFEE58&ln&#FFEB3B&le&#FDD835&ly&#FBC02D&lc&#F9A825&lo&#F57F17&lm&#F9A825&lb &#FBC02D&lB&#FDD835&ll&#FFEB3B&lo&#FFEE58&lc&#FFF176&lk&#FFF59D&ls
    @player
